      "english_translation": "Honest people always tell the truth."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 3,
      "japanese": "あなたが船でその島を訪ねると、A、B、Cという３人の住民がいっしょに港で迎えてくれました。",
      "english_translation": "When you arrived at the island by boat, A, B, and C, three residents, greeted you at the harbor."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "japanese": "その中のAとBは、次のように言いました。",
      "english_translation": "\"A and B, among them, said the following:\""
